OL,3,AIsrael to shut down UK consulate in
OL,4,AJerusalem in response to sanctions on
OL,5,AIsraeli settlements in West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign minister Gideon Saar says
OL,8,FIsrael will close the British consulate
OL,9,Fin Jerusalem - one of four
OL,10,F"counter-measures" against the UK
OL,12,FIsrael is also banning 11 MPs from
OL,13,Fentering the country, including Zarah
OL,14,FSultana, Jeremy Corbyn, and Diane
OL,15,FAbbott
OL,17,FThe move comes after Foreign Secretary
OL,18,FEd Miliband told Parliament the UK
OL,19,Fwould ban the import of goods from
OL,20,FIsraeli settlements in the illegally
OL,21,Foccupied West Bank
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
