OL,3,AIsrael to shut down UK consulate in
OL,4,AJerusalem in response to sanctions on
OL,5,AIsraeli settlements in West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FMiliband said "ethnic cleansing" was
OL,8,Fbeing carried out by "settler
OL,9,Fterrorists" and accused the Israeli
OL,10,Fgovernment of turning a "blind eye"
OL,12,FEleven countries - including France,
OL,13,FCanada, Spain and Poland - will
OL,14,Fimplement the same sanctions on Jewish
OL,15,Fsettlements in the West Bank, which are
OL,16,Fillegal under international law
OL,18,FIsrael has been planning to develop
OL,19,F1,200 new homes in the occupied West
OL,20,FBank and there has been a rise in
OL,21,Fsettler attacks on Palestinians this
OL,22,Fyear
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
